# Local proof signer allowlist

This directory is intentionally empty in the repository checkout. Before publishing a
proof, copy this file to `config/local-proof-allowed-signers` and add the OpenSSH
allowed-signers line for the operator key that is permitted to attest platform changes.

The private key must stay outside the repository and is selected with
`SIG_PROOF_SIGNING_KEY`. Publishing fails closed if either the key or allowlist is absent.
